msgstr "Done"

msgid "TUTORIAL_GRID_TITLE"
msgstr "The dungeon"

msgid "TUTORIAL_GRID_BODY"
msgstr "The dungeon is a grid of rooms seen from above. Use the arrow buttons to move one room at a time. You start on the green entrance. Red rooms hold monsters, purple rooms a treasure and blue rooms a sanctuary. Defeat every monster to complete the dungeon."

msgid "TUTORIAL_ENERGY_TITLE"
msgstr "Energy"

msgid "TUTORIAL_ENERGY_BODY"
msgstr "Everything in the dungeon costs energy (yellow bar): %s per step, %s per fight round, %s per flee attempt and %s to open a treasure. If your energy reaches 0, the expedition ends."

msgid "TUTORIAL_EXPERIENCE_TITLE"
msgstr "Dungeon XP"

msgid "TUTORIAL_EXPERIENCE_BODY"
msgstr "Experience earned in a dungeon is provisional (Dungeon XP bar). You keep it when you complete the dungeon or when you Retreat. You lose it if your energy or your life run out."

msgid "TUTORIAL_RETREAT_TITLE"
msgstr "Retreat"

msgid "TUTORIAL_RETREAT_BODY"
msgstr "Retreat only works on the green entrance. It costs %s energy, ends the expedition safely and keeps your dungeon XP. Save enough energy to walk back."

msgid "TUTORIAL_REST_TITLE"
msgstr "Rest"

msgid "TUTORIAL_REST_BODY"
msgstr "Rest costs %s mana and restores %s%% of your maximum life and %s%% of your maximum energy. Use it while exploring when you are tired or hurt."

msgid "TUTORIAL_SANCTUARY_TITLE"
msgstr "Sanctuary and treasure"

msgid "TUTORIAL_SANCTUARY_BODY"
msgstr "A sanctuary (blue room) restores %s to %s%% of your life, energy and mana, once per expedition. A treasure (purple room) is opened with Collect Treasure for %s energy: on a d20 roll of %s or more you gain %s XP, otherwise a trap deals %s damage."

msgid "STAT_LIFE"
msgstr "Life"

msgid "STAT_ENERGY"
msgstr "Energy"

msgid "STAT_MANA"
msgstr "Mana"

msgid "STAT_ARMOR"
msgstr "Armor"

msgid "STAT_STRENGTH"
msgstr "Strength"

msgid "STAT_SPEED"
msgstr "Speed"

msgid "STAT_REPUTATION"
msgstr "Reputation"

msgid "STAT_LIFE_HELP"
msgstr "Your health. Monster hits and traps lower it. If it reaches 0 the expedition ends, you lose the dungeon XP and keep a permanent life penalty. A monster at 0 life is defeated."

msgid "STAT_ENERGY_HELP"
msgstr "Spent in the dungeon: %s per step and %s per fight round. If it reaches 0 the expedition ends and the dungeon XP is lost. It refills when you leave the dungeon."

msgid "STAT_MANA_HELP"
msgstr "Magic power. Rest costs %s mana, and some attacks also cost mana."

msgid "STAT_ARMOR_HELP"
msgstr "Protection. The higher it is, the higher the d20 roll an attacker needs to hit."

msgid "STAT_STRENGTH_HELP"
msgstr "Attack power. It lowers the roll you need to get past the enemy's armor and adds 1 damage for every 2 points above %s."

msgid "STAT_SPEED_HELP"
msgstr "Agility. It helps you dodge attacks, makes your attacks harder to dodge and helps you flee."

msgid "STAT_REPUTATION_HELP"
msgstr "Fame. Completing a dungeon gives +1 for each monster defeated in it. Fill the bar to reach the next reputation level."

msgid "STAT_EXPERIENCE_HELP"
msgstr "The total XP you have kept. When the bar fills you level up and get %s points to spend in Progression."

msgid "STAT_DUNGEON_EXPERIENCE_HELP"
msgstr "XP earned in this expedition. It is provisional: kept when you complete the dungeon or Retreat at the entrance, lost if your energy or life run out."

msgid "STAT_HELP_CLOSE_HINT"
msgstr "Tap anywhere to close"

msgid "LEVEL_ALLOCATION_GUIDE_TITLE"
msgstr "What each stat does"

msgid "LEVEL_ALLOCATION_GUIDE_GROWTH"
msgstr "+%s per point"

